                "text": "A big change to our federal student loan system is coming \u2014 and it hits women the hardest. Fields like nursing, social work, and public health are overwhelmingly staffed by women, and new limits could make it harder to enter the careers our communities rely on.\n\nI break it all down in this week\u2019s Straight Talk With Scholten. Watch the full episode at the link below.\n\nhttps://t.co/yJeLojTlhU",
