                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke yesterday morning about why West Michigan sent me to Washington: to roll up my sleeves, tackle the hard issues, and get results. \n\nProtecting the ACA premium tax credits is about lowering costs and keeping health care within reach for the more than 27,000 people in my district who rely on them. Families shouldn\u2019t face skyrocketing costs or impossible choices about their care. \n\nThe clock is ticking, and I\u2019ll back any effort that lowers costs for the people of West Michigan.",
